<Legal title="Cookie Policy" description="What cookies and similar technologies TechTide SEO uses, and how to change your choices." updated="[DATE]">
  {/* TEMPLATE: have a qualified lawyer review and make the list match the tools you enable. */}
  <p>This policy explains the cookies and similar storage used on techtideseo.com.</p>
  <h2>Essential storage</h2>
  <p>We store your theme choice (light or dark) and your cookie choice in your browser's local storage. These make the site work the way you expect and are not used for tracking.</p>
  <h2>Analytics (optional)</h2>
  <p>If we have enabled analytics, they load only after you accept them. They may include Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity, which set cookies to measure visits and how people use pages. If you reject analytics, these tools are not loaded.</p>
  <h2>Forms</h2>
  <p>Our forms are processed by Formspree. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
  <h2>Changing your choice</h2>
  <p>Use the "Cookie settings" link in the footer to reopen the choice at any time. You can also delete cookies and site data in your browser settings.</p>
</Legal>
